  "design": {
    "idea": "Drain the West Lock Basin to descend onto the seabed beside a grounded mirror-raft, push the sightline lock-pin crate clear and aim the mirror east, then re-flood to float the mirror above the parapet and bank a blue shot across the channel.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "Draining a lock exposes grounded Tide Rafts and seabed blocks for hand-adjustment; re-flooding lifts reflect_only_floating mirrors into the firing plane.",
    "decisions": 5,
    "expert_s": 48,
    "reward": "opens_barge_channel",
    "why": "Develops linked lock_water state into a crisp drain -> adjust -> re-flood spatial puzzle.",
